Third-party source
===========

The JSystem sources under src/JSystem/ and the headers under include/JSystem/,
include/dolphin/, include/std/, include/types.h, include/macros.h,
include/mathHelper.h and libs/PowerPC_EABI_Support/include/ were imported
from the Mario Kart: Double Dash!! decompilation project
(https://github.com/doldecomp/mkdd), which is released under CC0 1.0
Universal. Many thanks to its contributors.

FSA's JSystem was built with MWCC GC/2.6 at -O4,p; these files are used
unmodified unless noted in git history.

JAIStreamMgr::stop(), JAISeMgr::stop(u32) and the JAISoundParams pitch property
in src/JSystem/JAudio/Interface/ follow the Twilight Princess decompilation
(https://github.com/zeldaret/tp).

Some JSystem sources and headers not present in mkdd (JMessage, extra JGadget
TUs) were adapted from the Pikmin 2 decompilation project
(https://github.com/projectPiki/pikmin2). Many thanks to its contributors.
The JGadget::binary::TParseValue templates and parts of the JMessage processor
(its tag parsing and the FSA-era TProcessor layout) follow the Wind Waker
(https://github.com/zeldaret/tww) and Twilight Princess
(https://github.com/zeldaret/tp) decompilations, with thanks.

Parts of src/JSystem/JParticle/ (JPAResourceManager swapTexture/getResUserWork) are based on the Twilight Princess decompilation (https://github.com/zeldaret/tp).
The J3D/GraphBase sources under src/JSystem/J3D/GraphBase/ and the matching
J3D headers under include/JSystem/J3D/ are adapted from the Pikmin 2
decompilation project (https://github.com/projectPiki/pikmin2), with thanks.

Some J3D loader sources (src/JSystem/J3D/GraphLoader/) and J3D header
additions are adapted from the Pikmin 2 decompilation project
(https://github.com/projectPiki/pikmin2).

src/JSystem/J3D/GraphAnimator/ is based on the Pikmin 2 decompilation project
(https://github.com/projectPiki/pikmin2), adapted to the mkdd headers. Many
thanks to its contributors.

Parts of src/JSystem/J3D/GraphAnimator/ (J3DDeformer::deform_VtxPosF32/
deform_VtxNrmF32, J3DFrameCtrl::checkPass, J3DAnmTransformFullWithLerp and the
J3DAnm* constructors) and the J3DCluster/J3DClusterKey/J3DClusterVertex layouts
are based on the Twilight Princess decompilation
(https://github.com/zeldaret/tp), with thanks.

Parts of src/JSystem/J2DGraph/ (J2DWindowEx, J2DPicture, J2DWindow) are adapted from the Twilight
Princess decompilation (https://github.com/zeldaret/tp) and Pikmin 2 decompilation (https://github.com/projectPiki/pikmin2).
